# items from the brake-pedal commentary videos (S-checklist-019, S-drafting-016)
@@ src/ant_pr_review/checklists/default.toml
- text = "Denial with a fix: does it say there is no defect, no fault or no problem and, in the same text, offer a free upgrade, inspection, replacement, 'design optimisation' or 'extra safety margin' without saying what it addresses? Readers take an unexplained preventive fix as an admission. Does it say what the fix is for and what is still being checked, or hold the offer until the findings say what it is for?"
