@@ src/ant_pr_review/checklists/default.toml
- text = "Verification: when the explanation rests on our own tests or internal review, can others check any of it (an accredited third party, the original tester invited to replicate or witness, sealed samples of the same batch, data we will publish)? Does it conclude on cause, safety or the other side's test method faster than that evidence allows, while naming fewer actions than conclusions? Fast actions, slow conclusions."
