@@ src/ant_pr_review/checklists/default.toml
- text = "Shared brands and joint ventures: where two or more organisations own, make, operate or sell the product, are their statements, figures and commitments the same, is there one voice for the brand, and is the split of responsibility agreed before it is tested in public? Does any test or report we cite say who commissioned it, and does the tester stand behind more than the samples it was sent? Co-owners disowning each other's evidence read as passing the blame."
