@@ src/ant_pr_review/checklists/default.toml
- text = "Governance (executives, board, rank-and-file staff, whistleblowers): how does each face and handle this, are their duties and statements aligned, and is anyone left to speak for the company without a mandate? Are executives and other spokespeople held to the approved line off the record, at events and on personal accounts, where a defiant aside, sarcasm or a prediction of an investigation's outcome reads as stubbornness?"
