@@ src/ant_pr_review/examples.toml
- lesson = "A co-owned brand cites a third-party test report: one owner says the other commissioned it, the other says it does not know, and the lab says it vouches only for the samples it was sent. Co-owners disowning each other's evidence read as passing the blame. Agree one voice and who stands behind each piece of evidence before it is published."
