@@ src/ant_pr_review/examples.toml
- lesson = "A test video shows a brake part breaking; the same-day statement says the system exceeds the national standard, no failure has occurred in real use and the test was extreme, then offers a free upgrade. A standard is a floor to the public, not an answer to a safety scare, and an upgrade offered next to 'no problem' reads as an admission. Give the risk boundary, evidence others can check and something owners can do."
+ lesson = "A test video shows a brake part breaking; the same-day statement says the system exceeds the national standard, no failure has occurred in real use and the test was extreme, then offers a free service. A standard is a floor to the public, not an answer to a safety scare, and an offer next to 'no problem' reads as an admission. Give the risk boundary, evidence others can check and something owners can do."
